{"timestamp": 1779400343.0534651, "event_type": "meeting_called", "tick": 26, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana called an emergency meeting", "bodies": [{"room": "storage", "victim_name": "Alice"}, {"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779400343.053913, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 26, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779400361.760323, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I called this because we\u2019ve got two bodies: Alice is in storage, Bob is in medbay.\n\nMy route was lower engine \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria. I saw Charlie in upper engine around tick 8, Alice in medbay around ticks 12-14, and Frank was leaving medbay toward electrical around tick 13. Then I saw Frank in electrical ticks 15-16, Charlie in electrical around tick 18, and later both Charlie and Frank in/near weapons around tick 24.\n\nI never saw Bob alive this round. Since Bob\u2019s body is in medbay, the main thing I can say is Frank had been in medbay right around when Alice was there. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but Frank should explain his medbay timing. Alice later ended up dead in storage, so whoever killed her must have gotten to storage after that."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400382.7537239, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons.\n\nI saw Diana in upper engine around ticks 7-8, then Bob alive in lower engine around ticks 12-13 \u2014 he came in from storage. I did pass through storage and medbay after that, and I didn\u2019t see either body when I went through, so Bob must have died in medbay after I passed or right around a timing I missed. I also saw Diana in security around tick 23, and Frank in weapons at tick 24. Eve was with me in weapons right before the meeting.\n\nI can confirm Bob was alive at 12-13 in lower engine. I never saw Alice this round. Frank being in/near medbay earlier is worth hearing, but I don\u2019t have a hard accusation yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400391.8711538, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security, then ended up in weapons with Charlie right before the meeting.\n\nI can add some timing info: I saw Alice alive entering storage from medbay around tick 17 \u2014 so she was alive well after Diana says she was in medbay at 12-14. And I saw Bob alive entering medbay from upper engine at tick 22. That means Bob was killed in medbay sometime after tick 22, which is pretty late in the round.\n\nSo whoever was in or near medbay around tick 22-24 is the prime suspect for Bob. I was in electrical and then security by that point \u2014 Charlie says he can place me in weapons at the end, which fits.\n\nDiana, you said your route ended cafeteria, but you also claimed to pass through medbay earlier and you said you never saw Bob alive \u2014 but Bob was alive in medbay at 22. Where were you between ticks 20-24? Your route as described doesn't clearly account for that window.\n\nI'm leaning Diana right now, but I want to hear Frank before locking in."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400820.562169, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security.\n\nI saw Bob in storage around tick 8. I saw Alice alive in medbay at ticks 12-13. Diana entered medbay from upper engine around tick 11, and then I left toward electrical. I was in electrical with Diana around ticks 16-17, so I was not back near storage or medbay after that.\n\nLater, at tick 23, I saw both Charlie and Diana enter weapons from security, and Diana left weapons toward cafeteria at tick 24. Charlie was also in weapons ticks 23-24.\n\nSo Diana pointing at me for medbay timing doesn\u2019t really fit: Alice was apparently alive later at tick 17 per Eve, and Bob was alive much later at tick 22 per Eve. The key thing is Eve says she saw Bob alive entering medbay at tick 22 \u2014 that means Eve was right there at the exact late timing Bob died. Diana was coming from security into weapons at 23, so I don\u2019t see how Diana kills Bob in medbay after 22 and gets there that fast.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Eve. She\u2019s placing herself as the last person with Bob and then trying to push it onto Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400844.5798368, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I need to push back on Eve\u2019s accusation: I was not near medbay at tick 22. My late route was electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria. I saw Charlie around electrical/security/weapons late, and Frank in weapons at 24. If Bob was alive entering medbay at 22 like Eve says, I don\u2019t think I physically could kill Bob in medbay and then be in weapons/cafeteria by the meeting timing.\n\nAlso, Eve is the one giving both \u201clast seen alive\u201d timings: Alice alive going into storage at 17, and Bob alive going into medbay at 22. That puts Eve near both victims shortly before they died. I didn\u2019t see Eve at all this round, which makes it harder to verify her route.\n\nFrank\u2019s medbay timing was earlier, but if Eve\u2019s Bob timing is true, then Frank is less likely for Bob. Right now I\u2019m more suspicious of Eve than Frank, because her info places her closest to both deaths."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400868.849768, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019ll clarify my info again since the late timing matters. I personally saw Bob alive in lower engine at ticks 12-13 coming from storage, but I never saw him after that. I passed storage and medbay afterward and didn\u2019t see bodies, so Bob\u2019s death in medbay sounds later than my route.\n\nI can confirm Diana was in upper engine early, then I saw her late in security around tick 23, and I saw her leave weapons toward cafeteria at tick 24. Frank was in weapons at tick 24. Eve was also with me in weapons right before the meeting.\n\nThe part that stands out to me is Eve\u2019s story puts her near both victims shortly before death: Alice entering storage at 17, Bob entering medbay at 22. That doesn\u2019t mean she\u2019s definitely Duck, but she has the closest \u201clast seen\u201d timings, and I didn\u2019t personally see her until the very end in weapons. Diana\u2019s late route to security/weapons lines up with what I saw, so I\u2019m less convinced on Diana now. I\u2019m leaning Eve unless someone has a stronger contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779400880.072324, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 26, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I hear you both, and I get why my timings look bad on the surface \u2014 but think about what I actually said. If I were the killer, why would I volunteer \"last seen alive\" info that puts a target on my own back? I could've just stayed quiet about seeing Bob at 22 and let this round die in confusion. I shared it because it's what I saw.\n\nYes, I saw Bob enter medbay from upper engine at tick 22. I was passing through \u2014 my route was medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security from there. Charlie, you can confirm I ended up in weapons with you right before the meeting. That fits a clean path away from medbay, not someone lingering to kill.\n\nHere's what bothers me about Frank's story: Frank, you said you saw Alice alive in medbay at 12-13 and that Diana entered medbay around 11. But Diana said she was in medbay around 12-14 and saw you leaving toward electrical at 13. Your stories kind of corroborate each other for the early window \u2014 which is convenient if you two need alibis for later.\n\nAnd Frank, you jumped on me really hard and fast. That's classic deflection when someone wants the heat off them.\n\nI'm between Frank and Diana, but Frank's aggressive pivot onto me is the bigger tell. I'm leaning Frank."}}
